### Requests for 05_logging_winston.js
### VS Code: install "REST Client" (Huachao Mao), then click "Send Request" above each block.
### Start the server first:
###   docker compose exec node node week07/class1/05_logging_winston.js
### After each request, look at the terminal, then logs/combined.log and logs/error.log

@base = http://localhost:3001

### info: "Home page visited" with the ip as extra data
GET {{base}}/

### One message per level. Only some show, depending on LOG_LEVEL
GET {{base}}/levels

### The tasks router from 02. morgan logs it at the http level
GET {{base}}/api/tasks

### Add a task -> 201
POST {{base}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Learn winston" }

### A route that throws -> error, written to error.log with the stack trace
GET {{base}}/api/boom

### No such route -> warn
GET {{base}}/nope
